    <string name="main_news_intro">Welcome to Neville for Everyone!</string>
    <string name="main_news_version_title">The current version includes these new features:</string>
    <string name="main_news_body">☘️ A new look that you can customize in Settings.\n\n☘️ Exclusive content from renowned authors including Joe Dispenza, Bruce Lipton, and Gregg Braden.\n\n☘️ A protected personal Journal for recording your progress and experiences.\n\n☘️ Biometric protection for your notes.\n\n☘️ Goals and personal transformation with neuroscience-backed healthy habits and guided programs.\n\n☘️ A creative Canvas for designing images with your favorite quotes and sharing them on social media.\n\n☘️ Reminders for recurring activities such as meditation or exercise.\n\n☘️ An Encyclopedia with selected content about the teachings of Neville and other authors.\n\n☘️ Scientific Evidence featuring properly cited research that supports the teachings in this work.\n\n☘️ 171 new Neville lectures, bringing the total to 472.\n\n☘️ An expanded collection of 1,071 quotes from various authors.\n\n☘️ 32 lecture excerpts.\n\n☘️ 36 Neville questions and answers.\n\n☘️ Add and share your own quotes.\n\n☘️ Theme and content customization.\n\n☘️ Copy text into or out of the app and send it to Notes, Quotes, or Canvas. To import text from another app, use Android’s Share menu.</string>
    <string name="main_news_closing">The spirit of the living God dwells within you!</string>
